{"id":"n28582-1-7","stage":3,"title":"농부 · 农夫","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28582-1-7-1","ko":"농부이신 아버지는 농사일로 우리 남매를 키우셨어요.","zh":"我们的父亲是农民，靠务农养大了我们兄妹俩。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"농부이신","meaning":"农夫，农民","explanation":"농부：农夫，农民；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"농부","audio":"/audio/88e7dc2a442ca48245b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28582","senseId":"1","lemma":"농부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농부이신","audio":"/audio/e9c626e68a89889213fb.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지는","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지는","audio":"/audio/c70c05233681f44d2334.mp3"}},{"text":"농사일로","meaning":"农活儿，庄稼活儿","explanation":"농사일：农活儿，庄稼活儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"농사일","audio":"/audio/43b999d4e3663fb22f30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28583","senseId":"1","lemma":"농사일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농사일로","audio":"/audio/5c2c1109f60af48bf4ae.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"남매를","meaning":"兄妹","explanation":"남매：兄妹；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"남매","audio":"/audio/2633d546c99bb4e3e98e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37834","senseId":"1","lemma":"남매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남매를","audio":"/audio/b695493d35f2e4a28a19.mp3"}},{"text":"키우셨어요.","meaning":"培育，培养","explanation":"키우다：培育，培养；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":